{"id":"998b9421ae6cd8b3","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds.md","title":"PER交并构造的精确界性质","display":"thm-vper-lattice-bounds — PER交并构造的精确界性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds","aliases":["72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds"],"display":"thm-vper-lattice-bounds — PER交并构造的精确界性质","depends_on":["[[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X PER semantics; full local intersection/least-upper-bound proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vper-lattice-bounds — PER交并构造的精确界性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d782aac0c1a67b9\" href=\"?note=9d782aac0c1a67b9\" title=\"72-df-vper-lattice-operations\">72-df-vper-lattice-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X PER semantics; full local intersection/least-upper-bound proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d782aac0c1a67b9\" href=\"?note=9d782aac0c1a67b9\" title=\"72-df-vper-lattice-operations\">72-df-vper-lattice-operations</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K,\\ \\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K,\\ \\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\subseteq S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\subseteq\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\subseteq S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\subseteq R\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal K\\ (S\\subseteq R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\subseteq R\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal K\\ (S\\subseteq R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>交的 PER 性与饱和性逐条展开；若每个 S 包含 R，它们的交也包含 R，反向由投影包含。生成上确界是所有上界之交，故它包含每个 S，且小于等于任一上界 R。空族已显式总化为顶与底。这证明成员关系空间的完备性，不声称任意依赖函数构造对关系包含单调。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-vper-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"9d782aac0c1a67b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-vper-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"9d782aac0c1a67b9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}$ 取 [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]；$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，$R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K,\\ \\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).","display":true},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\subseteq S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K\\subseteq R\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal K\\ (S\\subseteq R).","display":true}],"bytes":1672,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operation